{% include "fragments/narration.md" %}

{% include "fragments/coach_story_shape.md" %}

Below is a map of the record, not the record itself: who is in it, how many events each person has, every event with its id, date, kind and people, and the version it was drawn at. Look before you add: read the events or people you need, and add only what is not there yet. Change only what the story needs. Name the version when you change or remove something. If a change is refused because the record moved on, read again and use the new version.

